    fix(cabinet): key prefs shell branches by identity and context
    
    Remount legacy and agent branch roots when shell token or agent context
    changes so prefs state cannot leak across users or contexts.
    
    Co-authored-by: Аведикян Карен <karenavedikyan@users.noreply.github.com>

diff --git a/src/components/layout/CabinetAppShellClient.branch-key.test.tsx b/src/components/layout/CabinetAppShellClient.branch-key.test.tsx
